[{"title":"登泰泉山椒和天游峰字韵二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"万仞烟霞一短筇，绿蒲黄菊尽仙踪。\n安期海上空遗舄，崔相庵前秖断峰。\n道在沧洲应易得，笑缘尘世每难逢。\n何时更定云岑约，幞被同听野寺钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4494,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登泰泉山椒和天游峰字韵二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"瑶空飞翠可扶筇，仙侣淩秋觅异踪。\n樵径风清闻落木，海门霞起混高峰。\n蟹泉瀹茗吟边酌，虹涧寻花醉里逢。\n翻笑十年尘土梦，马蹄空趁景阳钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4495,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南园吊古用梨韵","author":"黄佐","text":"南园秋草蔚萋萋，来谒新祠路不迷。\n五岭炫烟曾跃马，百年忠愤但闻鸡。\n逢崖往事西风冷，蹈海高名北斗齐。\n却恨天津明月夜，杜鹃啼血上棠梨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4496,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵答周八崖宪长见怀","author":"黄佐","text":"六月芙蓉开绛英，粤池遥带楚湘清。\n山中麋鹿堪吾友，地上麒麟羡尔行。\n玉殿翠云怀北极，石林红日卧前荣。\n瑶华忽慰音尘隔，南浦悠悠梦旆旌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4497,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日田园杂兴次郑大尹韵 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"农圃归来荷圣朝，暖风迟日出迢遥。\n青黄夹路携儿看，花竹成畦课仆浇。\n牛带寒鸦过别浦，叶随流水聚平桥。\n年来自觉疏慵甚，无奈流莺早见招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4498,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日田园杂兴次郑大尹韵 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"黄犊悠悠不用鞭，绿杨袅袅未舒绵。\n即看喜气通丘壑，已有和风到海天。\n陌上斗歌人似月，花间吹笛酒如泉。\n年来种秫开三径，不为青山有杜鹃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4499,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春效白沙","author":"黄佐","text":"烟树苍苍黄鸟飞，草堂春晚故人稀。\n北风卷雪马犹去，西水漫天船未归。\n性拙久拚玄鬓改，家贫长恐素心违。\n雨馀天阔芳蹊暖，无数红香点褐衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4500,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春兴和邓沃泉韵","author":"黄佐","text":"春回盘谷瘴烟消，千古青云近斗杓。\n丹凤有书传此日，白驹何事永今朝。\n粤山采药穿云倦，珠海寻僧泛月遥。\n招得草堂猿鹤伴，碧桃花里醉仙瓢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4501,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏灯花次余仲栗韵","author":"黄佐","text":"天涯芳草翠连空，惟有寒灯相对红。\n金粟光芒如向月，银缸开谢肯随风。\n赤城霞起明窗里，太乙星移绛帐中。\n忽忆炬莲随佩马，十年恩宠向谁浓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4502,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李稚大广右视学","author":"黄佐","text":"吹剑当年歌昔游，十年尘梦对三洲。\n湘山似戟马前出，楚水如丝天际流。\n监禄岂知终化俗，伏波何用更封侯。\n离弦莫奏清商曲，梧叶萧萧已报秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4503,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月与内姻兄弟登龙冈答梁应民二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"龙冈亭榭倚岧峣，采采黄花不惮遥。\n陟岵看云移白日，长松高茑入丹霄。\n风回古寺千山叶，野阔寒江万里潮。\n曝背有怀还北望，可堪关塞正萧萧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4504,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"九月与内姻兄弟登龙冈答梁应民二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"江湖独卧逢人少，风日重阳发兴赊。\n碧海波光依帽落，白云山色抱檐斜。\n松萝正尔堪杯酒，蓬鬓何曾愧菊花。\n帝圃仙台休更问，笑看天地有烟霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4505,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南江卷为冯侍御子仁题","author":"黄佐","text":"南江之水向南流，谪仙结庐栖上游。\n真源混混自天地，巨浪轰轰连斗牛。\n鸣皋玄鹤月当夜，入馔白鱼风报秋。\n浩歌放浪渺然去，为尔芦间寻钓舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4506,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灵洲晓发","author":"黄佐","text":"妙高台前郁水流，宝地祇林何太幽。\n雨晴山向镜中出，潮长舟从天上游。\n鹏风忽送扶光晓，蜃月犹含珠海秋。\n一尊取醉挂帆去，渺渺沧波飞白鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4507,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山寻铁壁泉源宴挹泉亭次王十竹韵二首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"云构初成风籁清，翠寒当户接流声。\n禺阳凤竹自秋色，赵叟鱼台空月明。\n铁壁长年锵玉佩，沧江终日驻霓旌。\n酒阑更觅飞来迹，直上蓬山绝顶行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4508,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"峡山寻铁壁泉源宴挹泉亭次王十竹韵二首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"萧寺重过亭榭新，十年烟艇实藏身。\n有情峡鸟催沽酒，无赖江花笑问津。\n极北云烟看欲近，天南冰雪坐疑真。\n尊前却忆乘骢使，彩笔题诗合有神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4509,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺右林莽中寻达磨石小憩戏作一转语","author":"黄佐","text":"淩空飞锡结嶙峋，薝卜香中草自春。\n鸟度云移今此世，鸿冥天阔我何人。\n羲娥断送千年梦，龙象终成一聚尘。\n便合拈花发微笑，沧波无语月华新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4510,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次韶州奉怀黎韶山用赠行韵","author":"黄佐","text":"对酒联舟忽异乡，曲江回望粤山长。\n九成台上箫韶远，二相楼前草木香。\n春殿独摇苍水佩，秋风偏洒碧荷裳。\n徘徊家国情何限，云白天青自一方。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4511,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日宴凤来亭呈同游符陈二使君","author":"黄佐","text":"危亭开宴逼秋穹，五马同游一马骢。\n岐路即看千里近，劝酬真觉四愁空。\n楚山北向青如簇，肄水南来曲似虹。\n笑指九成台上凤，来仪应在碧梧中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4512,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"扬历岩醉后咏月","author":"黄佐","text":"明牧招携上翠微，金尊倾罢玉蟾飞。\n桂枝似向淮岩出，纨扇疑从汉苑归。\n泽国鱼龙疏作雨，江干鸥鹭久忘机。\n广寒共是曾游客，莫唱开元旧羽衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4513,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过岭瞻望张丞相祠","author":"黄佐","text":"蹇蹇宗臣起海涯，荆州南去为谁家。\n鼓鼙尘里青骡远，鹰隼风前紫燕斜。\n揭日声华垂宇宙，格天英采在云霞。\n十年旧路生秋草，长忆寒梅绕树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4514,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登吴山驿楼晓望","author":"黄佐","text":"楼外缁尘望不昏，榣山高峙彩云屯。\n潮声近欲兼溟渤，树色遥应接蓟门。\n桑柘影疏嗟亢旱，芰荷衣薄藉朝暾。\n凭高倚剑歌回首，家在天南烟水村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4515,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日东墅探梅简刘东溪中丞","author":"黄佐","text":"招携东墅探寒梅，冷蕊疏枝尚未开。\n绣豸金貂频促席，吴歌楚舞肯停杯。\n东皇已正苍龙驭，灵女虚传赤凤来。\n风籁萧萧归路晚，采芳何处是春台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4516,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫僚燕集次许松皋冢宰韵四首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"玉河皓皓树苍苍，歌管催春入燕觞。\n四海簪缨趋圣主，万年圭鬯属元良。\n风云灿烂铜扉里，日月光华玉殿傍。\n留滞周南通籍晚，只将麟趾咏姬昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4517,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫僚燕集次许松皋冢宰韵四首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"桂宫兰殿倚穹苍，绮席淩寒绿满觞。\n银榜自今晖日月，金台从古重贤良。\n鸾镳合沓瀛洲里，凤吹飘摇太液傍。\n既醉不愁归路暝，上台光彩属文昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4518,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫僚燕集次许松皋冢宰韵四首 其三","author":"黄佐","text":"宫槐院柳竞寒苍，仙侣开筵荐羽觞。\n周诵师资曾作圣，桓荣稽古亦称良。\n榣山睇视西山外，南斗追趋北斗傍。\n自笑冥鸿随羽翼，即从诒宴颂隆昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4519,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫僚燕集次许松皋冢宰韵四首 其四","author":"黄佐","text":"前星炯炯天苍苍，高云斐亹明霞觞。\n鸿逵岂谓羽仪少，鹤禁正须筹策良。\n燕京馆阁玉霄上，魏阙衣冠珠斗傍。\n阳春忽奏郢中调，万岁飞龙应寿昌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4520,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重午谩兴","author":"黄佐","text":"萧艾青青烟雨中，锦囊谁与奏薰风。\n骖驔骏骑来燕市，迢递翔鶤仰汉宫。\n竹叶谩随人意绿，榴花孤倚客窗红。\n去年此日衡门下，笑看菖蒲碧涧东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4521,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬至早过承天门时同行者赵校书罗赞善唐司谏闵中允谢司直","author":"黄佐","text":"去年济水逢长至，今日蓬山得并游。\n西苑未闻归大内，南郊何处礼圆丘。\n葭传淑气三千界，鼎现丹光十二楼。\n最是昔曾趋走地，朝阳依旧殿东头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4522,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲江晓发赠别符颖江太守","author":"黄佐","text":"曲江流水混晴霞，岭树阴阴背郭斜。\n八月扬舲趋鹤禁，十年垂钓向鸥沙。\n旷筵挥麈欢无极，明牧连驺兴未涯。\n锦寺剧谈支遁躅，帽亭遥指邵平瓜。\n隋珠几见传仙掖，韶石重来驻使槎。\n忧世旧愁怜杜甫，阜民新调协虞华。\n芙蓉国里三千首，烟雨楼前十万家。\n杯酒论文更何地，春风应在紫薇花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4523,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"恭谒孝陵侧望懿文墓","author":"黄佐","text":"紫金积翠镇重泉，绛节扬灵护九玄。\n五色云车龙渺渺，万行珠树鹤翩翩。\n鼎湖风雨秦淮水，缑岭烟霞句曲天。\n玉玺一从归冀北，郁葱佳气自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4524,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玉亭侍家慈宴坐述怀","author":"黄佐","text":"玉亭幽胜颇宜人，喜奉潘舆眺望频。\n龙阙日高吴苑曙，凤台花发蒋陵春。\n巢林乌鸟声偏乐，入馔鲥鱼味更新。\n犹自倚楼思梦里，南溟天阔有垂纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4525,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌八首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"采桑南陌去，共欢桑下嬉。\n归来理机素，成匹待何时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4526,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌八首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"黄鸟双双飞，园林春意早。\n欢爱绯桃花，侬爱菤葹草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4527,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌八首 其三","author":"黄佐","text":"团团合欢扇，摇动生薰风。\n辗转罗帏里，时复障颜容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4528,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌八首 其四","author":"黄佐","text":"乘凉登水榭，见那采莲船。\n石阙映芙蓉，含悲谁复怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4529,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌八首 其五","author":"黄佐","text":"猛风吹梧桐，玉露坠金井。\n蹋歌人不闻，明月照双影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4530,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌八首 其六","author":"黄佐","text":"门前霜枫树，洒泪积成许。\n蛛网罥黄蘖，腹中苦思汝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4531,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌八首 其七","author":"黄佐","text":"白雪满庭户，朱火耀窗牖。\n清歌侑兰觞，郎笑揽侬手。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4532,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子夜四时歌八首 其八","author":"黄佐","text":"枯木噪寒雀，开门欢正来。\n炭炉火未冷，思心欲成灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4533,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘符卿使楚","author":"黄佐","text":"扬舲向荆楚，渺渺烟波涛。\n河桥挥手后，酒醒明月高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4534,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁子席上赏葵","author":"黄佐","text":"萧飒天南鬓，羁留冀北身。\n凭将向阳意，一为问花神。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4535,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"风雨与张景川酌","author":"黄佐","text":"风雨送深秋，千山木叶流。\n黄花犹自艳，知为故人留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4536,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禾雀","author":"黄佐","text":"两三啁哳雀，飞飞自容与。\n天地无网罗，郊原熟禾黍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4537,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄堂八景为罗大参题 其一 绿潭灵源","author":"黄佐","text":"大岗发灵源，绿潭何迤逦。\n松涛翻翠寒，秀色亘千里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4538,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄堂八景为罗大参题 其二 上涌烟村","author":"黄佐","text":"烟树横一抹，微茫混天色。\n林疏见夜灯，点点讶奎壁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4539,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄堂八景为罗大参题 其六 丹桂山香","author":"黄佐","text":"丹桂孤巍巍，移根自蟾穴。\n空翠从风来，万古香不灭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4540,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄堂八景为罗大参题 其三 紫峒天衢","author":"黄佐","text":"天衢在丹霄，紫峒相与通。\n常有五色云，飞绕蓬莱宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4541,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄堂八景为罗大参题 其四 东冈晓日","author":"黄佐","text":"商歌闻饭牛，长夜嗟未旦。\n东冈忽摇白，织乌动层汉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4542,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄堂八景为罗大参题 其五 西岸夜渔","author":"黄佐","text":"寒潮拥西岸，渔艇互相呼。\n答歌不知夜，皓月生菰蒲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4543,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄堂八景为罗大参题 其七 村头翠竹","author":"黄佐","text":"徙倚村头望，翠竹干云霄。\n欲截凤凰管，凭谁叶虞韶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4544,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玄堂八景为罗大参题 其八 冈背青松","author":"黄佐","text":"冈背何所有，历历青松树。\n飒飒悲风来，恍恍神灵雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4545,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题居竹轩","author":"黄佐","text":"清阴满窗户，幽人澹无语。\n翠影交龙蛇，白日惊风雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4546,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题寒江小景","author":"黄佐","text":"大地阳初复，寒江雪独深。\n古崖空老树，渔艇忽拿音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4547,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄易司训体乾","author":"黄佐","text":"北雁飞南天，蒹葭霜月圆。\n美人千里隔，深夜一灯悬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4548,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题倭扇画鼠","author":"黄佐","text":"喜遇秦丞相，悲逢汉大夫。\n不知当磔日，犹记太仓无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4549,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月出","author":"黄佐","text":"月出群犬嗥，月入群犬静。\n幽人耿不眠，翛然发孤咏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4550,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦热","author":"黄佐","text":"月淡万籁寂，更寒百蛩语。\n道人据槁梧，挥扇自驱暑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4551,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游南华次章朴庵韵漫作禅语","author":"黄佐","text":"南能无伎俩，妙境还谁履。\n拈花裂虚空，莫问如何是。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4552,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双井梧桐小景","author":"黄佐","text":"凤鸟久不至，鲁叟悲道穷。\n谁从双井上，手自种梧桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4553,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画鸠","author":"黄佐","text":"大地龙正蛰，江山望禾黍。\n枝间闻女声，苍林自风雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4554,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画练鹊","author":"黄佐","text":"蓬蒿恣浼鹊，羽翼何翘翘。\n何如舍之去，玉立当云霄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4555,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日游郑氏庄","author":"黄佐","text":"寒食园林载酒，暖风帘幕啼莺。\n高阁一回欹枕，小楼何处吹笙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4556,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词","author":"黄佐","text":"迟日桃花浦上，轻风杨柳矶边。\n鼓枻一声欸乃，中流遥见湘烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4557,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谷雨燕坐偶成","author":"黄佐","text":"檐前当树阑珊，竹外鸣鸠往还。\n隐几只销香篆，蔷薇开遍东山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4558,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"潞河晓发","author":"黄佐","text":"楼前淼淼潮平，陌上萧萧马鸣。\n孤月徘徊芳渚，五云缭绕神京。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4559,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"文渊阁登望嘉靖乙酉","author":"黄佐","text":"八柱高檠远汉，四檐长纳明霞。\n渺渺碧山云树，重重紫禁烟花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4560,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌词十首 其一","author":"黄佐","text":"圣驾南巡江水清，凯旋惟恐露威灵。\n虎贲夜散常山阵，龙气朝缠细柳营。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4561,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌词十首 其二","author":"黄佐","text":"从官鹄立侍牙樯，中贵蝉联进玉觞。\n百万貔貅齐喝采，载歌常武贺君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4562,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌词十首 其三","author":"黄佐","text":"氛祲全销玉剑寒，鲸鲵京观筑如山。\n风生虎帐刁斗静，日照龙江旌旆闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4563,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌词十首 其五","author":"黄佐","text":"瓜步寒潮两坝通，居民今得醉春风。\n红楼夜夜歌琼树，月堕河翻乐未终。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4564,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凯歌词十首 其六","author":"黄佐","text":"不杀天声本帝心，大江魑魅暗山林。\n夏廷合铸神奸鼎，九牧遥闻已贡金。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":4565,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]